  "note": "The Foray clock over every committed Foray, through the page's own build of it (player/parity/forays.js clockAudit): the document's runtime_sec agrees with the clock within check-forays.mjs's 0.5 s (so the one committed jingle counts its 3.0 s, OQ-6), every item starts where the last ended, every start maps back to its item, and forayElapsed round-trips. Authored invariants, so a publish that edits or adds Forays cannot turn them red — only one that breaks the clock. A Foray deleted from data/ must drop its case here.",
